          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#opposites Opposites
          %p
            The opposite of a homwise-discrete category is again a homwise-discrete category. However, the opposite of a 2-congruence in
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi K
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} K
            is a 2-congruence in
