            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/opposite+2-category"} 2-cell duals
            interchange fibrations and opfibrations. Likewise, passage to opposites takes 2-forks in
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
